# Generic keystores are ignored, EXCEPT the project's committed release keystore
# + properties. This is a private repo and the stable key is what enables in-place
# in-app updates. If you make the app public, move these to GitHub Actions secrets.
*.keystore
*.jks
keystore.properties
!/app/starmap-release.jks
!/keystore.properties

